            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tester…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The album you choose goes to every file that has none yet, and Lidarr works out which track each one is.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Det album, du vælger, gælder for alle filer, der ikke har et endnu, og Lidarr finder selv ud af, hvilket nummer hver fil er."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The app talks to Sonarr, Radarr, qBittorrent and the rest itself. You add their addresses and API keys next.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Appen taler selv med Sonarr, Radarr, qBittorrent og resten. Du tilføjer deres adresser og API-nøgler bagefter."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The arr found nothing to import here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Arr'en fandt intet at importere her."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download failed and is stuck in the queue: {reason}": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloadet mislykkedes og sidder fast i køen: {reason}"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The download has stalled ({state}) — no data is moving.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Downloadet er gået i stå ({state}) — ingen data flytter sig."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The episodes, films and books that come out today.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "De afsnit, film og bøger, der udkommer i dag."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The library isn't available.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Biblioteket er ikke tilgængeligt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their files are deleted from disk, freeing about %@. This cannot be undone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Filerne slettes fra disken, hvilket frigør omkring %@. Det kan ikke fortrydes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tema"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This server can't import files by hand.": {
      "localizations": {
        "da": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Denne server kan ikke importere filer manuelt."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Those seasons are unmonitored so they are not fetched again; the shows stay.": {
      "localizations": {
